<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A rather complicated piece of laser technology that was primarily developed as a siege weapon to generate explosions within hardened bunkers. In order to miniaturize an emplacement weapon without needing a massive power unit, the shoulder-mounted laser fires in irregular pulses with a frequency between kHz and MHz. The results are hard to dispute as it can cause a devastating blast, however it has a limited effective range and a long warm-up period to charge the capacitor banks.-->
  <VFEP_Box_SalvagedLaserEradicator.description>一种为战棺设计的攻城武器，采用了仍处于试验阶段的尖端激光科技。其发射的高功率不稳定光束能够造成威力十足的爆炸，但射程也相对较近，射击前需要更长的预热充能时间。\n\n该武器通过使用临时电池来进行预热，连续射击可以显著的提高射击速度。\n\n这把武器在完全预热后会高速过热，从而导致武器中的电池发生爆炸。</VFEP_Box_SalvagedLaserEradicator.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket salvaged laser eradicator-->
  <VFEP_Box_SalvagedLaserEradicator.label>战棺组装激光湮灭炮</VFEP_Box_SalvagedLaserEradicator.label>
  <!--EN: An enlarged laser weapon, combining both modern and antique methods into a compact package. Taking advantage of a greater weight tolerance, this system includes a revolver cylinder using advanced battery cells instead of cartridges. This allows the weapon to fire more powerful shots at a slower warmup reduction, meaning safer sustained fire for the operator.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_LaserBlaster.description>一种为战棺设计的激光武器。能够发射高功率聚焦光束以造成巨量损害。\n\n该武器通过使用高级电池来进行预热，连续射击可以显著的提高射击速度。\n\n这把武器在完全预热后有可能会过热，从而导致武器中的电池发生爆炸。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_LaserBlaster.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket laser blaster-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_LaserBlaster.label>战棺激光爆裂枪</VFEP_WarcasketGun_LaserBlaster.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_LaserBlaster.tools.0.label>枪管</VFEP_WarcasketGun_LaserBlaster.tools.0.label>
